{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/33842-don-t-run-home-to-mama","id":33842,"title":"Don't Run Home to Mama!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-20T07:13:48-08:00","id":33842,"title":"Don't Run Home to Mama!","content":"<img src=\"https://scontent-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn1/1522028_10100181179941268_1434260122_n.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> From Rage Across the World 20 <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> The hardest part of 2014 is going to be waiting to hear if there will be a Changeling 20....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T08:10:11-08:00","id":33873,"title":"","content":"I'm not a huge fan of <b>Werewolf</b>, but seeing this ad at the end of <i>Rage Across the World</i> made me feel like I was 100% correct for supporting the <b>W20</b> Kickstarter!<br /> <br /> Also, I'm decently sure that we'll hear confirmation of <b>Changeling 20</b> next year... Like <b>Wraith</b>, it's a